                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.741/34: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-06-10T19:00:00-03:00">June 10, 1943—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 10—6:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1284. I am reliably informed that President Ramírez has just signed a decree
                    suspending the use of code language in all international radiotelephonic and
                    radiotelegraphic communications.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
